<title>NETHERLANDS: KNP BT 96 ordinary net more than halved.</title>
<headline>KNP BT 96 ordinary net more than halved.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996 to end-December</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit from ordinary ops	 231     vs  545</p>
<p>    Net from ord ops/shr (guilders)	1.92  vs    5.05</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)			0.85  vs    1.75</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		     13.64  vs   15.04</p>
<p>    Operating profit			 554     vs  917</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items		     nil    vs   75.0 charge</p>
<p>NOTE - Dutch paper group NV Koninklijke KNP BT was expected by analysts to post a full-year net from ordinary operations of 202-245 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Net profit				 231     vs  470</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 570 8500 lved lved</p>
